        "content": "小哲，物體越重，密度就一定越大嗎？",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:48:49.144397+00:00",
        "metadata": {}
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 3,
        "speaker_type": "student",
        "speaker_id": "misconception",
        "content": "可是比較重的東西摸起來通常也比較扎實，我還是不懂為什麼不能只看重量。",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:48:52.933530+00:00",
        "metadata": {
          "emotion": "confused",
          "provider": "ollama-guarded",
          "behavior_type": "on_task",
          "guarded": true,
          "guard_reason": "role_consistency",
          "misconception_strength": 3
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 4,
        "speaker_type": "teacher",
        "speaker_id": null,
        "content": "小晴，同一材料切成小塊後，密度會改變嗎？",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:48:52.951332+00:00",
        "metadata": {}
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 4,
        "speaker_type": "student",
        "speaker_id": "reserved",
        "content": "密度不會因為大小改變而改變，是吧？",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:48:56.708927+00:00",
        "metadata": {
          "emotion": "curious",
          "provider": "ollama",
          "behavior_type": "on_task",
          "guarded": false,
          "guard_reason": null,
          "misconception_strength": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 5,
        "speaker_type": "teacher",
        "speaker_id": null,
        "content": "小宇，你有在聽嗎？請回答剛才的問題。",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:48:56.720886+00:00",
        "metadata": {}
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 5,
        "speaker_type": "student",
        "speaker_id": "distracted",
        "content": "老師，我剛剛有點沒跟上，可以再說一次問題嗎？",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:49:00.532312+00:00",
        "metadata": {
          "emotion": "confused",
          "provider": "ollama-guarded",
          "behavior_type": "distracted",
          "guarded": true,
          "guard_reason": "role_consistency",
          "misconception_strength": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 6,
        "speaker_type": "teacher",
        "speaker_id": null,
        "content": "小宇，回到問題：質量相同時要怎麼比較密度？",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:49:00.544626+00:00",
        "metadata": {}
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 6,
        "speaker_type": "student",
        "speaker_id": "distracted",
        "content": "質量相同時，體積小的密度大，體積大密度小。",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:49:04.531506+00:00",
        "metadata": {
          "emotion": "confident",
          "provider": "ollama",
          "behavior_type": "redirected",
          "guarded": false,
          "guard_reason": null,
          "misconception_strength": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 7,
        "speaker_type": "teacher",
        "speaker_id": null,
        "content": "小哲，密度是質量除以體積，所以不能只看質量。請舉例再說一次，對不對？",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:49:04.543157+00:00",
        "metadata": {}
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 7,
        "speaker_type": "student",
        "speaker_id": "misconception",
        "content": "舉個例子，水在結冰時質量不變，體積變大，密度變小，這就說明密度不是看質量就能判斷了。",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:49:08.804551+00:00",
        "metadata": {
          "emotion": "confused",
          "provider": "ollama",
          "behavior_type": "on_task",
          "guarded": false,
          "guard_reason": null,
          "misconception_strength": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 8,
        "speaker_type": "teacher",
        "speaker_id": null,
        "content": "小哲，再比較質量和體積的比值，所以密度不能只看重量。請用自己的話再說一次。",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:49:08.815261+00:00",
        "metadata": {}
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 8,
        "speaker_type": "student",
        "speaker_id": "misconception",
        "content": "所以還要看它占多少體積，不能只看重不重，對嗎？",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:49:12.615329+00:00",
        "metadata": {
          "emotion": "confused",
          "provider": "mock",
          "behavior_type": "on_task",
          "guarded": false,
          "guard_reason": null,
          "misconception_strength": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 9,
        "speaker_type": "teacher",
        "speaker_id": null,
        "content": "小安，如果兩個物體體積相同，要怎麼比較密度？",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:49:12.627250+00:00",
        "metadata": {}
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 9,
        "speaker_type": "student",
        "speaker_id": "active",
        "content": "體積一樣的話，密度大代表質量大，密度小則質量小，這樣就能比較了。",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:49:16.710311+00:00",
        "metadata": {
          "emotion": "confident",
          "provider": "ollama",
          "behavior_type": "on_task",
          "guarded": false,
          "guard_reason": null,
          "misconception_strength": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 10,
        "speaker_type": "teacher",
        "speaker_id": null,
        "content": "小明，最後請你說說看，為什麼不能只用重量判斷密度？",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:49:16.725604+00:00",
        "metadata": {}
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "session_id": "82504eece3554b94a815328a60b5f2d7",
        "turn_number": 10,
        "speaker_type": "student",
        "speaker_id": "typical",
        "content": "重量是質量，密度是質量除以體積，所以質量相同但體積不同，密度也不同。",
        "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:49:20.745316+00:00",
        "metadata": {
          "emotion": "confident",
          "provider": "ollama",
          "behavior_type": "on_task",
          "guarded": false,
          "guard_reason": null,
          "misconception_strength": 1
        }
      }
    ]
